# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — the provider lock file
# is what makes `terraform init` reproducible. Commit it after the next init.

# Working notes: handoff docs, positioning strategy, archived planning output.
# Kept in the working copy for convenience, never committed — they describe
# career context rather than the project, and this repo is public.
# Not covered by any backup: `git clean -fdx` will delete them.
/.notes/
